---
source: crates/cadmus/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout
---
Self-evolving coding agent: self-built loop, OpenAI-compatible dialects, coding tools with gated workspace writes

Usage: cadmus <COMMAND>

Commands:
  chat  Chat with the agent (one shot: prompt in, final answer out), with coding tools confined to the current directory; workspace writes are denied unless approved (see --yes)
  eval  Run the eval set (evals/cases) against the fixture workspaces and write the aggregate score file; each run's scores are also recorded as score events in that run's trajectory log
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
